  "policy": [
    "Shared 650-character overlapping inference windows and postprocessing; no test-set tuning.",
    "Existing decoders frozen from earlier PAGE development; Gov FIRST aggregation fixed to the reviewed Presidio integration.",
    "EstNER uses flat ner_1, GPE mapped to LOCATION. Tokens joined by spaces and sentences by newline; original whitespace unavailable.",
    "Court corpus: 397 ambiguous LOC_ORG spans excluded from strict scoring; LOC/ORG predictions fully inside them neither rewarded nor penalised. MISC excluded. Not the paper all-label metric.",
    "PAGE annotations incomplete: exact/overlap/coverage recall only, no precision or F1. Page split within one collection, not independent identities.",
    "Published test sets are not necessarily independent of checkpoint development. Historical Tartu comes from court experiments; EstBERT and its Gov derivative have EstNER training-domain connections.",
    "Macro F1 weights PER/ORG/LOC equally and is not directly comparable with the earlier blog headline. Small differences are descriptive; no significance test claimed.",
    "Neither Gov model was exported/benchmarked as q8 here; no browser speed or ONNX package size claimed.",
    "No source-document text or private prediction excerpts included."
  ]
}
